<section class="layout-default">
<h2>Math</h2>
<p>Inline <span data-math-style="inline">E = mc^2</span>, escaped <span data-math-style="inline">a &lt; b</span>, and display:</p>
<p><span data-math-style="display">\int_0^1 x^2 \, dx = \frac{1}{3}</span></p>
<div data-math-style="display">\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}</div>

